  </p>

  <h2 id="specialisation">Residential vs commercial vs hospitality: which track pays more</h2>

  <p>
    Almost every fresher starts in residential design because it is the most available work. Very few
    deliberately move toward the two tracks that actually pay a premium.
  </p>

