      usually somewhere around year two or three, to stop taking every residential lead that comes in and
      start building a name in one lane instead. There is a practical cash-flow reason to pick commercial or
      hospitality specifically: those clients tend to pay on invoice terms and settle on time, while
      individual homeowners are far more likely to delay payment mid-project.
    </p>
  </div>

