    Rs 30,000-90,000 a month on residential work, before it either stalls at that level or scales sharply
    once a referral base and a specific reputation form. Designers who reach Rs 50,000 a month to
    Rs 1 lakh a month usually did one thing consistently: they picked one pricing model, one client type,
    and one specialisation, instead of quoting every project differently and chasing every client type at
