  </p>

  <div class="honest-take">
    <p class="honest-take__label">Honest take</p>
    <p>
      Running your own studio is not just design work with better margins. It is sales, vendor negotiation,
      cash-flow management, and collections, on top of design. The designers who actually reach Rs 2-5 lakh
      a month in independent practice almost always describe the business skills, pricing discipline,
      deposits before starting work, clear scope in writing, saying no to underpriced projects, as the real
      reason they scaled, not a sudden jump in design talent.
    </p>
  </div>

